cost that callers\npay, but not evidence that uniku generates UUIDs faster, and not a noise control.\nIt is also the row that moved most between runs (1.2× to 1.6×)."],[327,"**They are not reproducible to the digit.** Two runs of the same command on the\nsame machine moved the small-ratio rows by up to 22% (UUID v4, TSID, ObjectID,\nXID), and a different machine moved the ULID row from 163× to \\~85×. That is why\nthe table reports ranges rounded to about one significant figure instead of the\nfour significant figures a single run prints."],[330,"**Two rows are not like-for-like on work done.** The TypeID, KSUID, and TSID rows\ncompare uniku returning its primary value directly against a reference that\nallocates an object first. That gap is real for callers, but it measures API shape\nas much as encoding speed."],[305,"\\~0.6–0.65×"],[317,"\\~0.6–0.7×"],[301,"\\~0.65×"],[277,"\\~1–1.6×"],[355,"\\~1.0 KB"],[357,"\\~1.0 KB"],[345,"\\~1.2 KB"],[359,"\\~1.2 KB"],[325,"\\~1.3×"],[285,"\\~1.4–2×"],[361,"\\~1.5 KB"],[313,"\\~1.5–1.7×"],[363,"\\~1.6 KB"],[349,"\\~1.7 KB"],[365,"\\~1.7 KB"],[347,"\\~1.8 KB"],[351,"\\~1.9 KB"],[371,"\\~101 B"],[321,"\\~2–2.6×"],[281,"\\~2–3×"],[367,"\\~2.1 KB"],[297,"\\~2.5–3.5×"],[353,"\\~2.9 KB"],[369,"\\~445 B"],[289,"\\~6–7.5×"],[309,"\\~7–9×"],[293,"\\~85–165×"],[536,"`_tag`"],[533,"`_tag` for discriminated matching, compatible with Effect's `catchTag`."],[69,"`--alphabet`"],[26,"`--count`"],[29,"`--json`"],[110,"`--json`"],[121,"`--json`"],[66,"`--length`"],[76,"`--length`"],[43,"`--lowercase`"],[53,"`--lowercase`"],[49,"`--monotonic`"],[39,"`--name`"],[41,"`--namespace`"],[101,"`--node-bits`"],[99,"`--node`"],[59,"`--prefix`"],[119,"`--quiet`"],[117,"`--stdin`"],[51,"`--timestamp`"],[82,"`--timestamp`"],[87,"`--timestamp`"],[92,"`--timestamp`"],[97,"`--timestamp`"],[108,"`--type`"],[115,"`--type`"],[36,"`--uuid-version`"],[70,"`-a`"],[67,"`-l`"],[77,"`-l`"],[27,"`-n`"],[60,"`-p`"],[37,"`-v`"],[548,"`'BufferError'`"],[542,"`'InvalidInp